# CLDR carries no relative-type--2 for Hausa.  shekaranjiya is glossed
# "day-before-yesterday" in two independent Chadic comparative wordlists on
# ha.wikipedia.org (the Polci and Geranci articles), which is the attestation
# this file rests on.  There is no relative-type-2 counterpart: no source
# consulted attests a day-after-tomorrow word, so none ships.
shekaranjiya
